{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This application replaces the classic Alt-Tab switcher with a fluid, and deeply configurable interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core is a powerful Theme Editor that gives you control over every visual element. It's designed to be performance-conscious, ensuring your system runs smoothly whether you're working or gaming.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Total Visual Control:</strong> Change everything from window shapes, corner roundness, and borders to fonts and colors. Use solid colors or create complex gradients.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personalize Your Icons:</strong> Go beyond the defaults. Customize individual application icons using your own Images or even animated GIFs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improved Navigation:</strong>\u00a0Navigate the alt tab menu using keys, mouse clicks, or mouse wheel scrolling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Your Own Images:</strong> Set custom background images for the main switcher window and for the individual app items within it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fine-Tune Your Layout:</strong> Precisely control the size, spacing, and flow of application windows within the switcher to create the perfect layout for your workflow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hardware-Accelerated Performance:</strong> The entire interface is hardware-accelerated, ensuring a smooth and responsive experience even with dozens of open windows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Workshop Integration:</strong> Share your unique designs and download  themes from the community for free.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blacklist Support</strong>: Hide certain windows from appearing in your Alt Tab window at all! (Toggleable)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3798470?t=1757686133","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3798470?t=1757686133","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798470/7e06ba3afcaaed0232e031b92df50a16b0b8a343/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757686133","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798470/7e06ba3afcaaed0232e031b92df50a16b0b8a343/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757686133","categories":[{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This application replaces the classic Alt-Tab switcher with a fluid, and deeply configurable interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its core is a powerful Theme Editor that gives you control over every visual element. It's designed to be performance-conscious, ensuring your system runs smoothly whether you're working or gaming.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Total Visual Control:</strong> Change everything from window shapes, corner roundness, and borders to fonts and colors. Use solid colors or create complex gradients.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personalize Your Icons:</strong> Go beyond the defaults. Customize individual application icons using your own Images or even animated GIFs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Improved Navigation:</strong>\u00a0Navigate the alt tab menu using keys, mouse clicks, or mouse wheel scrolling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use Your Own Images:</strong> Set custom background images for the main switcher window and for the individual app items within it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fine-Tune Your Layout:</strong> Precisely control the size, spacing, and flow of application windows within the switcher to create the perfect layout for your workflow.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hardware-Accelerated Performance:</strong> The entire interface is hardware-accelerated, ensuring a smooth and responsive experience even with dozens of open windows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Workshop Integration:</strong> Share your unique designs and download  themes from the community for free.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blacklist Support</strong>: Hide certain windows from appearing in your Alt Tab window at all! (Toggleable)</p></li></ul>","developers":["Maze Guy Hex"],"dlc":[3949260],"genres":[{"description":"Design & Illustration","id":"53"},{"description":"Utilities","id":"57"},{"description":"Game Development","id":"60"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798470/f9722ee9fe59f52f82422d4fb2628c4e70da9817/header.jpg?t=1757686133","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Alt Tab Toolkit","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10, 11</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Maze Guy Hex"],"ratings":null,"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"October 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798470/2882ab76254280adf94e4106f1fa79d98124ee77/ss_2882ab76254280adf94e4106f1fa79d98124ee77.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757686133","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798470/2882ab76254280adf94e4106f1fa79d98124ee77/ss_2882ab76254280adf94e4106f1fa79d98124ee77.600x338.jpg?t=1757686133"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798470/cda524ff456597d35bd085fc6c228f62c2c10efb/ss_cda524ff456597d35bd085fc6c228f62c2c10efb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757686133","path_thumbn